<title>USA: Galileo acquires Sani-Spec line from Bard.</title>
<headline>Galileo acquires Sani-Spec line from Bard.</headline>
<dateline>STURBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Galileo Corp said on Tuesday it acquired the Sani-Spec product line from C.R. Bard Inc for $5.5 million.</p>
<p>The line of women's health products used by doctors and hospitals had revenues of over $4 million last year, Galileo said.</p>
<p>Galileo uses fiber optics and electro optics to make products in the medical, telecommunications, analytical-detector and office-products areas.</p>
